Z||000020||onfire||12-09-2001||03:26 AM||||I like widescreen versions. I have an RCA 48" tv with a soon to be fixed hairline crack in the screen. With a Technics receiver, a Technics 5 disc cd changer. A Panasonic DVD player. A crappy Symphonic VCR, I don't do much with VHS. The speakers are Infinity sm 112's with KLH surround speakers. I have about 80 DVD's. I hook up the laptop every now and then to play mp3's through the home stereo. Or movies I downloaded off the net. <P>Now all I need is my own place so I can turn up the volume. <BR>  <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/onfiresig.gif"> ||||reg||1
